Changes made for Swarm Studio (scripts/import-od-systems.mjs):
- Only the colours (surface, text, primary, secondary), the heading and body font, the medium corner
  radius and the first line of the visual theme are kept. Dropped: the rest of DESIGN.md (components,
  spacing, motion, voice boilerplate, anti-patterns, translations), the full token scale (surfaces,
  borders, shadows, type scale, spacing, motion), components.html, previews and Tailwind files.
- Fonts that are not Google Fonts families, and display faces used as body text, are replaced; each
  replacement is listed in the pack's `dropped` field.
- Who each look is for, the words that suggest it, the voice, the picture style and the storyboard
  were written for Swarm Studio; they are not from either source.
- Systems named after a real company, product, person or game were not imported.
